OL,3,AUK expected to announce sanctions on
OL,4,AIsraeli settlements in occupied West
OL,5,ABank
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK is expected to announce
OL,8,Fsanctions on trade from Israeli
OL,9,Fsettlements in the illegally occupied
OL,10,FWest Bank - what you need to know
OL,12,FDates, mangoes and avocados are among
OL,13,Fthe produce exported from settlements -
OL,14,Fhere's how the UK handles such goods
OL,16,FAll Israeli settlements in the West
OL,17,FBank are illegal under international
OL,18,Flaw. The UK's restrictions come as
OL,19,FIsrael plans to develop 1,200 new homes
OL,20,Fin the occupied territory
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
