OL,3,AUK expected to announce sanctions on
OL,4,AIsraeli settlements in occupied West
OL,5,ABank
OL,6,
OL,7,FSettler attacks on Palestinians have
OL,8,Falso increased this year, with the UN
OL,9,Fsaying injuries have risen to an
OL,10,Faverage of three a day
OL,12,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband will
OL,13,Foutline the UK sanctions in Parliament
OL,14,Flater - he recently called Israel's
OL,15,Fsettlement construction plans "the
OL,16,Fcrossing of a red line"
OL,18,FMeanwhile, the US ambassador to Israel
OL,19,FMike Huckabee tells the BBC British
OL,20,Ffirms could be "banned" from doing
OL,21,Fbusiness in a number of US states due
OL,22,Fto the sanctions
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
