OL,3,AHarry and Meghan 'surprised' by King's
OL,4,Aletter making clear they remain
OL,5,Anon-working royals
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spokesperson for the Duke and Duchess
OL,8,Fof Sussex says they were surprised to
OL,9,Fsee a letter sent on behalf of King
OL,10,FCharles clarifying that Prince Harry
OL,11,Fand Meghan remained non-working royals.
OL,13,FThe spokesperson said the couple, who
OL,14,Fhave recently moved back to the UK,
OL,15,F"were a little surprised not to have
OL,16,Fbeen told about this in advance".
OL,18,FBut royal sources say Prince Harry and
OL,19,FMeghan were made aware of the letter,
OL,20,Fsent on Monday afternoon, before it was
OL,21,Fmade public.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
