OL,3,AHarry and Meghan 'surprised' by King's
OL,4,Aletter making clear they remain
OL,5,Anon-working royals
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is also understood a security
OL,8,Fcommittee, which includes Home Office
OL,9,Frepresentatives, is meeting this week
OL,10,Fto look at the level of taxpayer-funded
OL,11,Fsecurity that should be given to the
OL,12,FSussexes who are now resident in the
OL,13,FUK.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
