CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1788864491
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AA&E did not get the basics right - my
OL,4,Ason's life was ruined at 32
OL,5,
OL,6,FOli's case is just one of a growing
OL,7,Fnumber of clinical negligence claims
OL,8,Fbeing made in England relating to A&E
OL,9,Fcare. An analysis by the BBC shows
OL,10,Fthere has been a 41% rise in cases over
OL,11,Fthe past five years, with doctors
OL,12,Flinking it to the long delays and
OL,13,Fpressures being seen in emergency
OL,14,Fdepartments.
OL,16,FOli's father, Stephen, says he knows
OL,17,FA&E staff are under pressure, but he
OL,18,Fcannot understand how a brain scan was
OL,19,Fnot ordered, given his son's medical
OL,20,Fhistory.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
