OL,3,ATrial over alleged murders of
OL,4,AAustralian surfer brothers starts in
OL,5,AMexico
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree men have gone on trial in Mexico
OL,8,Ffor the alleged murders of two
OL,9,FAustralian brothers and their American
OL,10,Ffriend in 2024.
OL,12,FThe bodies of Callum Robinson, his
OL,13,Fyounger brother Jake, and their friend
OL,14,FCarter Rhoad from California - all in
OL,15,Ftheir early 30s - were found at the
OL,16,Fbottom of a well with gunshot wounds to
OL,17,Ftheir heads, days after they went
OL,18,Fmissing during a surf trip in Baja
OL,19,FCalifornia.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
